{"product":{"id":8088641765630,"title":"RYSE Loaded Pre-Workout","body_html":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eRYSE Loaded Pre-Workout\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eA balanced, fully-dosed \u003cstrong\u003epre workout\u003c\/strong\u003e built for everyday lifters, gym-goers, and active adults who want clinical-grade pumps, energy, and focus without the extreme caffeine load of a hardcore stim formula. Particularly suited to those stepping up from beginner pre-workouts who want serious performance benefits — without the racing heart and over-stimulation that comes with the heaviest products in the category.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat separates Loaded Pre-Workout from a generic stim formula comes down to dose accuracy and ingredient selection. Each scoop delivers 4.5g of pure L-Citrulline for genuine nitric oxide production and pumps, 3.5g of clinically-dosed Beta-Alanine for muscular endurance and lactic acid buffering, plus a smart caffeine system that combines a regular dose of caffeine anhydrous with 120mg of patented zumXR® extended-release caffeine. That extended-release component is the key technical detail — it spreads the energy curve over the full session rather than spiking and crashing inside the first 30 minutes, which is the failure point of most cheap pre-workouts. The formula also adds a nootropic stack including 10mg of Thinkamine™ (trademarked Vincamine) for sharp focus without the jittery edge. Fully transparent label, no proprietary blends.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eRYSE manufactures Loaded Pre-Workout in the United States in \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/health-topics\/good-manufacturing-practices\"\u003eGMP\u003c\/a\u003e certified, FDA-registered facilities, with patented and trademarked ingredients (zumXR®, Thinkamine™) used throughout the formula. Note: Loaded Pre is not Informed-Sport certified — competing tested-pool athletes should choose a sport-certified alternative; for everyone else, the transparent labelling and patented ingredient quality make it a credible pick at a more accessible stim level than RYSE's heavier formulas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e4.5g pure L-Citrulline per scoop\u003c\/strong\u003e for genuine pumps and blood flow during training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e3.5g clinical-dose Beta-Alanine\u003c\/strong\u003e for muscular endurance and reduced fatigue under load\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDual-source caffeine including 120mg zumXR® extended-release\u003c\/strong\u003e for no-crash, sustained energy across the full session\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e10mg Thinkamine™\u003c\/strong\u003e plus a nootropic stack for sharp focus without jittery overstimulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFully transparent label, no proprietary blends\u003c\/strong\u003e — solid value at the \u003cstrong\u003epre workout price in Sri Lanka\u003c\/strong\u003e category for daily training, more accessible than ultra-high-stim alternatives\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePair it with a quality whey or recovery shake from our \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"\/collections\/protein-powder\"\u003eprotein and recovery range\u003c\/a\u003e to round out a complete training stack.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"RYSE","product_type":"PRE-WORKOUT","created_at":"2023-07-15T14:56:19+05:30","handle":"ryse-loaded-pre-workout","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:23:43+05:30","published_at":"2025-04-03T00:01:26+05:30","template_suffix":"ryse","published_scope":"global","tags":"STIMULANT","variants":[{"id":45748485390590,"product_id":8088641765630,"title":"30 Servings \/ Kool-Aid™ Grape","price":"14999.00","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price":"0.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"30 Servings","option2":"Kool-Aid™ Grape","option3":null,"created_at":"2024-08-28T23:02:58+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:23:43+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":"98927102","g